<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Winkelhaak edges into Sept qtr profit.</title>
<headline>Winkelhaak edges into Sept qtr profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Sept versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib profit		   0.01 vs 6.82 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 4.22 vs 2.70</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 318,000 vs 310,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		1,715 vs   1,738</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    5.4 vs 5.6</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 53,610 vs 57,678</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    54,978 vs 53,620</p>
<p>Full name: Winkelhaak Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd .</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
